# ───────────────────────── Admin panel (server-only — NEVER VITE_) ─────────────
# Production FAILS CLOSED without these. Generate the secret:
#   openssl rand -hex 32
# ADMIN_USER=ops
# ADMIN_PASS=use-a-long-random-passphrase
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=paste-64-hex-chars-min-32-chars
# Login throttle is DB-backed (wolfpit_rate_limit, applied by both migrators):
# 5 failed attempts / 15 min per username (+ 20 / 15 min per IP), counted
# ACROSS all instances, reset on successful login, fail-closed when the store
# is unreachable — set DATABASE_URL in production.

# ───────────────────────── Markets / launch gates ─────────────────────────────
VITE_CHAIN=sim
# VITE_CHAIN=base-sepolia
# VITE_CHAIN=base
# Which desks are open. Launch = spot only (DEX aggregator route); add
# future,option when the WETH/USDC pit pool is seeded.
VITE_MARKETS=spot
# VITE_MARKETS=spot,future,option

# Optional geo: hide futures/options ticket for US until counsel flips
# VITE_GEO=us-block

# ───────────────────────── Spot swap (real, on-chain) ─────────────────────────
# The /swap desk executes real market orders on Base via a DEX aggregator
# (0x Swap API v2) with best-execution routing. Fees are taken ON-CHAIN and go
# directly to the WolfPit wallet. See src/lib/swap/*.
#
# Server-only aggregator key (NEVER prefixed VITE_ — must not reach the browser):
# ZEROX_API_KEY=your-0x-api-key
#
# WolfPit fee wallet — receives the on-chain trading fee ("directly to WolfPit"):
# VITE_FEE_RECIPIENT=0xYourWolfPitFeeWallet
#
# Trading fee in basis points (default 50 = 0.50%) and the WPIT-holder discount
# (default 0.5 = 50% off). Discount only applies once VITE_WPIT is a live token;
# until then every wallet pays the full fee.
# VITE_SWAP_FEE_BPS=50
# VITE_SWAP_FEE_DISCOUNT=0.5
# VITE_SWAP_SLIPPAGE_BPS=50
#
# Slippage tolerance is clamped to 1-500 bps (0.01%-5.00%) in the UI AND on the
# server (src/lib/swap/config.ts SLIPPAGE_MIN/MAX_BPS) — the tolerance shown is
# always the tolerance executed.
#
# Chains the WolfPit trading fee is collected on (comma-separated chain ids).
# Default Base-only: the fee is paid on-chain to VITE_FEE_RECIPIENT on the swap
# chain, and an address that exists on Base may have no owner elsewhere (e.g. a
# Base-only Safe) — extend this list ONLY after verifying the recipient on each
# chain. On chains outside the list no integrator fee is charged.
# VITE_FEE_CHAINS=8453
#
# Optional dedicated Base RPC for reads (balances/allowance). Falls back to the
# public viem/chains Base endpoint when unset.
# VITE_BASE_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
#
# Multi-chain swap desk: swaps work on every chain the aggregator serves
# (Base ★, Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Polygon, BNB, Avalanche, Gnosis,
# Celo, Mantle, Blast, Linea, Scroll, ZKsync, Unichain, Berachain —
# src/lib/swap/chains.ts). Per-chain RPC overrides for client reads, JSON map:
# VITE_RPC_URLS={"8453":"https://mainnet.base.org","1":"https://eth.llamarpc.com"}

# ───────────────────────── Contracts (Base) ───────────────────────────────────
# VITE_CHAIN=base flips the header chip to "Base live" ONLY when VITE_VAULT is
# also set (the desk itself is still the sim engine until the chain adapter
# lands — see docs/DEV.md). Without VITE_VAULT the chip reads "Base · paper".
# VITE_VAULT=0x...
# VITE_POOL_ETH_USDC=
# VITE_POOL_WPIT_USDC=
# VITE_POOL_WPIT_ETH=
# VITE_WPIT=
# VITE_FARM=
# VITE_STAKE=

# Deploy (see docs/DEPLOY-BASE.md — forge script contracts/script/DeployBase.s.sol)
# Also used server-side to verify WPIT balances for the live-swap fee discount
# (falls back to the public Base endpoint when unset).
# BASE_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
# Chainlink ETH/USD aggregator on Base — fetch the CURRENT address from
# data.chain.link (Base network) at deploy time. No default: fail-closed.
# BASE_ORACLE_AGG=0x...
# BASE_OWNER=0xmultisig
# BASE_OPERATOR=0xkeeper-hot-key
# BASE_USDC=0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913   # native USDC (verify)
# BASE_WETH=0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000006   # canonical WETH
# Allow the deploy script to run on any chain (default: Base mainnet only)
# BASE_ALLOW_ANY_CHAIN=1
# ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=

# ───────────────────────── Keeper (Rust) ──────────────────────────────────────
# WOLFPIT_RPC=https://mainnet.base.org
# WOLFPIT_VAULT=0x...
# WOLFPIT_CHAIN=base
# WOLFPIT_KEEPER_KEY=0x...        # operator private key, env only (never a CLI flag — WP-14)
# WOLFPIT_KEEPER_KEY_FILE=/path   # preferred: read the key from a 0600 file instead
# WOLFPIT_GATE_DERIVE_HOST=1

# ───────────────────────── Auth (deployed) ────────────────────────────────────
# Dev defaults to auth-off via config/app-env.json. Production sign-in:
# VITE_AUTH_ENABLED=true
# WOLFPIT_AUTH_CLIENT_ID=
# WOLFPIT_AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=
# WOLFPIT_AUTH_ISSUER=https://your-auth-broker.example.com
# BETTER_AUTH_URL=https://your-app.example.com
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=openssl-rand-hex-32
# Hosted live preview (optional; broker holds the real secrets):
# WOLFPIT_PREVIEW_ISSUER=https://your-auth-broker.example.com
# WOLFPIT_PREVIEW_HOST_SUFFIX=example.com      # accept *.example.com callbacks
# WOLFPIT_PREVIEW_CLIENT_SECRET=               # NOT committed anywhere
# VITE_PREVIEW_HOST_SUFFIX=example.com         # match in the browser bundle

# ───────────────────────── Database ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Empty/unset = local PGLite, which is DEV-ONLY. PGLite is an in-process
# Postgres: even where it boots it is per-instance and per-process, so nothing
# written to it is shared between serverless invocations. It also does NOT boot
# on Vercel at all — its .wasm/.data assets are not emitted into the function
# bundle, so getSql() throws ENOENT '_libs/pglite.data' on every request.
#
# SET DATABASE_URL IN ANY DEPLOYED ENVIRONMENT. Without it:
#   - the admin pause/geo-fence switches are not binding (nothing to write to),
#   - the login throttle has no shared counter,
#   - and the app runs on the environment policy below instead.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host/db

# ───────────────────────── Trading kill switch (no database needed) ───────────
# Last-resort halt for when the policy store is unreachable or not yet
# provisioned. Read on every order-accepting call and composed as a UNION of
# restrictions with the database policy: either source can PAUSE, neither can
# lift the other. Un-pausing therefore means clearing BOTH.
# Accepted true values: 1, true, yes, on (case-insensitive). Unset/0 = off.
# WOLFPIT_TRADING_PAUSED=1
# WOLFPIT_TRADING_PAUSED_REASON=oracle outage 2026-09-01, ops on call
# Refuse geo-gated products (future/option/race) to US and to unverifiable IPs.
# Spot is never geo-gated.
# WOLFPIT_GEOFENCE_US=1
